      "en": "An old oak forest in the mountains of Europe"
    },
    "image": "place.jpg",
    "intro": {
      "en": "The book never names its forest, so we picked a real one where every animal in it lives together: the Carpathian Mountains of Romania, home to the biggest brown bear population in Europe outside Russia."
    },
