          "src": [
            "adw-hog"
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": {
            "en": "Hoglets"
          },
          "text": {
            "en": "Babies are called hoglets, usually four or five at a time. Their spines are hidden under soft skin at birth and pop out within a day."
